{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id1112110013"}, "name":{"label":"arr-key"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-17T15:22:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.20.3"}, "id":{"label":"10950437308"}, "title":{"label":"a beautiful picture that hangs in a vacuum"}, "content":{"label":"I used to adore this app, but time flows. Though it looks almost perfect at first glance while you testing it and playing with the demo project, in reality, the app has no integrations or public API, only poor mail-forwarding logic like it was in the late 90s. It’s also impossible to attach any file, even a photo. In addition, it displays Markdown text after finishing editing it in a really weird counterintuitive way, without the possibility of switching to the normal mode of formatted text. So, even UI by itself ceased to be an undeniable strong point. I don't understand why they shoot themselves in the leg, rejecting applying obvious improvements to such important things.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
